amage, the claim process is initiated within 24 hours, supported by photographic evidence and a detailed inventory. The insurer settles the claim directly with the client, ensuring a hassle‑free experience."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I track my belongings in real time during the Kumardhubi‑to‑Mumbai journey?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. Every container truck in the fleet is equipped with satellite‑based GPS and a live‑tracking portal. Customers receive a unique tracking ID that lets them monitor the exact location, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations. Packers And Movers Kumardhubi Dhanbad prioritize transparency throughout the transit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What documents do I need to prepare before the move, and why are they important?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Key documents include a signed service agreement, a detailed inventory list, GST invoice, e‑Way bill for interstate transport, and proof of insurance. These ensure regulatory compliance, smooth customs clearance (if applicable), and enable seamless reimbursement for corporate or government transfers. Packers And Movers Kumardhubi Dhanbad assist in preparing and filing each document."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the 4‑protocol zero‑damage system differ from standard moving practices?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The system integrates pre‑move site survey, custom crating, real‑time load monitoring, and post‑delivery verification. Each protocol is executed by trained technicians using hydraulic ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. This structured approach reduces handling errors by over 90 % compared to generic movers, guaranteeing that your assets arrive intact."}}]}
